+The frozen launcher targets only `case_zero_load_control.toml`, one native step, one CPU thread, and at most 512 points. Its working directory is `pgfrag/tmp/review_20261004/pd_point_event_probe/OUT`, which must be empty. Snapshots and process receipts are written to sibling directories named `snapshots` and `receipts`. The launcher records the actual Julia process exit code only when observed; otherwise it records JSON `null` as unknown, plus any launch/wait exception. A timed-out child retains its observed exit code and `timed_out=true`; the wrapper returns 124 for timeout and 125 when start/wait status is unknown or errors. Existing receipts/logs are never overwritten.
 
